  "description": "**When one woman attempts to flee the kingdom that killed her family, she winds up stranded in a curious mansion with a man who can help her escape. Will they remain at odds, or warm up to one another? Find out in this steamy romance webtoon that will get you heated!**\n\nLysithea Hilenaire Del Arman is a woman on the run. After a dangerous revolt claimed the lives of her family, Lysithea employs the broker, Taron Cardis, to help her escape the kingdom before she meets the same deadly fate. But Taron isn’t exactly the easiest man to work with, and the two spend most of their transactional relationship with plenty of bickering and arguing. That is, until an unexpected snowstorm leaves them stranded in an eerie, abandoned mansion. Now, Lysithea and Taron must put their differences aside to survive the cold and continue their escape.\n\nAs the temperatures outside drop, things inside the mansion heat up as burning desire ignites between Lysithea and Taron. Will they resist the pull towards each other or will temptation lead them down a more dangerous path? Experience the flames of passion in this sexy, full-color webcomic!\n\n*Source: Seven Seas Entertainment*",
